Package: drivux
Version: @SURUM@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: abdullahnil <https://github.com/abdullahnil>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), fuse3, libnotify-bin
Recommends: rclone
Homepage: https://github.com/abdullahnil/drivux
Description: Google Drive client: mount Drive as a disk and sync folders
 Drivux is a GNOME-style Google Drive client built on rclone. It mounts
 Google Drive as a disk in the file manager and keeps selected folders in
 two-way sync. A first-run wizard installs rclone and connects the account.
